{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_kummer_specialisation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_kummer_specialisation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Group.Int","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Abs"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_kummer_specialisation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_kummer_specialisation","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L47-L65","doc":"**Kummer specialisation** ([`prop:ns-kummer-specialisation`]).\n\n(i) non-divisor levels have non-vanishing obstruction — *proved* as the\ncontrapositive of `kappa_iff_dvd`; (ii) non-divisor levels are\nunbounded — *proved* outright from `χ(A) ≠ 0` via `Int.le_of_dvd`\n(a divisor of `χ(A)` is at most `|χ(A)|`); (iii) restates\n`kappa_iff_dvd`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:ns-kummer-specialisation","label":"prop:ns-kummer-specialisation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/ns-kummer-specialisation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.kappa_iff_dvd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.kappa_iff_dvd","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L45-L45","doc":"**(iii) — the cohomological computation:** the obstruction vanishes\nat level `n ≥ 1` exactly when `n ∣ χ(A)` (Kummer levels). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.kappa_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.kappa_vanishes","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Predicate: the obstruction `κ₀ mod n` vanishes in `H²(S, G_m)/n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.chi_A_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.chi_A_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L40-L40","doc":"**Setup:** the Euler characteristic is non-zero (e.g. `-6` for the\nDescartes universe); divisibility by every `n` would otherwise be\nvacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.chi_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.chi_A","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Euler characteristic `χ(A)` of the QOU substrate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsKummerSpecialisationContext","kind":"class","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_kummer_specialisation.lean#L30-L45","doc":"Hypotheses for the Kummer-level specialisation (§7c: `ℤ`/`ℕ`\narithmetic, no ring parameter).  Only the divisibility\ncharacterisation (iii) and the non-degeneracy of `χ(A)` are assumed;\nsub-claims (i) and (ii) are *proved* in `ns_kummer_specialisation`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}